{
  "slug": "norma-claude-skill",
  "name": "Norma Claude Skill",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "EU compliance methodology + 32 ready-to-adapt templates for AI Act 2024/1689, ISO 42001:2023, NIS2 (Directive 2022/2555), DORA, ISO 27001, ISO 22301, ISO 27701, and the Cyber Resilience Act. Auto-activates on framework-flavored questions and routes to the right reference + template subset. Italian-first prose with English headers. Not legal advice. (~395 chars — long enough to carry all 8 framework keywords for trigger-matching, short enough to fit typical 500-char limits. If the form rejects for length, trim the framework parentheticals first: keep AI Act 2024/1689 and ISO 42001:2023 with versions, drop versions on the rest.)",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `norma` (EU compliance methodology and templates).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install norma-claude-skill@claude-community` from `kynosure-ai/norma-claude-skill`.\n\nEU compliance methodology + 32 strategic-subset templates for AI Act, ISO 42001, NIS2, DORA, ISO 27001, ISO 22301, ISO 27701, CRA — adapted from the NORMA corpus by Kynosure.",
